{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 32,
  "name": {
    "ja": "ダークエルフの王",
    "en": "Dark Elven Lords Quest",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 25,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "ダークエルフの王の小集団がこの街に小さな店を建てました。",
          "私には商売敵は必要ありません。店の中の全員を殺して下さい。",
          "報酬ははずみます。その店はこの建物の裏にあります。",
          "たくさん護衛がいますから注意して下さい。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "A small group of Dark Elven Lords have set up a small shop",
          "in town.  I do not need any competition, so kill everything ",
          "in their shop.  You will be very well rewarded.  There shop",
          "is located in a building behind this one.  They are well",
          "guarded so be careful.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["ありがとうございます！外にお礼が置いてあります。"],
        "en": ["Thank you!  Your reward is waiting outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["このクエストはあなたの手におえなかったようですね。他のを試して下さい。"],
        "en": ["The quest was more than you could handle.  Try another one.   "],
      },
    },
  ],
